<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-PaineWebber cuts Enron.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-PaineWebber cuts Enron.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>PaineWebber has cut its rating on Enron Corp to neutral from attractive, said a source.</p>
<p>-- No further details were available.</p>
<p>-- Enron this morning said that it has revised its 1997 earnings target down by $0.30 to $2.25 after it reported a net loss of $1.17 per share after a charge and an operating profit per share of $0.40.</p>
<p>-- Its stock closed at 40-4/16 yesterday.</p>
<p>((--New York Newsroom 212 859 1902))</p>
</text>
